        "mandatory_observed": true,
        "requires_confirmation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "不同投标供应商投标文件“文件创建标识码”不得一致。",
        "category": "delivery",
        "source_range": {
          "start_ref": "C001-S032",
          "end_ref": "C001-S032"
        },
        "mandatory_observed": true,
        "requires_confirmation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "投标人不得存在法律、法规、规章、规范性文件规定的其他情形。",
        "category": "delivery",
        "source_range": {
          "start_ref": "C001-S033",
